Players: [Smith (Sender), Guild Master (Receiver)]; Types: [Master (c_M=1), Apprentice (c_A=3)]; Signal: s (units of premium steel);
Payoffs: Master: 120 − c_M·s, Apprentice: 60 − c_A·s;
Separating equilibrium: 0 < s < 60 (any s >0 works), cheapest separating s*=20.
