Players: [Crew]; Strategies: [Raider (proportion p), Trader (proportion 1‑p)]; Payoffs: V=4, C=6, S=1;
E(R)=p·(V‑C)+(1‑p)·V = 4‑2p;
E(T)=p·0+(1‑p)·S = 1‑p;
Average fitness F = p·E(R)+(1‑p)·E(T);
Replicator equation: dp/dt = p·(E(R)‑F). Equilibrium at p* = V‑S / (V‑S + C) = 0.6; stable because dp/dt changes sign around p*.

