Players: Governor (G), NovaDrill (N);
Strategies: N = {Enter, StayOut}; G = {Accommodate (cost 3 if pre‑committed), Fight};
Payoffs without commitment: (Enter, Accommodate) = (4,4), (Enter, Fight) = (1,0), (StayOut, —) = (5,0).;
Payoffs with commitment (burn 3 ore if Accommodate): (Enter, Accommodate) = (1,4), (Enter, Fight) = (1,0), (StayOut, —) = (5,0).;
Result: Commitment makes Fight dominate, N anticipates Fight, chooses StayOut, giving G payoff 5.

